Perfect! I can see the issue now:

1. In [register/+page.svelte:38-41](app/src/routes/register/+page.svelte#L38-L41), the snapshot is correctly implemented using Superforms API:
   ```typescript
   const { form, enhance, message, capture, restore } = superFormObj;

   // Use Superforms snapshot support for browser navigation state preservation
   export const snapshot = { capture, restore };
   ```

2. But in [login/+page.svelte](app/src/routes/login/+page.svelte), the snapshot support is NOT implemented. The file only destructures `{ form, enhance, message }` and doesn't export the snapshot.

Let me check the other files that have forms to see which ones are missing the snapshot support.

